355,"Plant Name: Rose
Botanical Name: Rosa indica / Rosa chinensis
Local / Known Names: Gulab, Desi Gulab, Hybrid Rose
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Sunlight (6+ hours daily)
Watering Instructions: Water moderately when top 1-2 inches of soil feel dry. Avoid overhead wetting to prevent black spot fungal disease.
Soil Requirements: Well-draining rich loamy soil with pH 6.0 - 6.5 enriched with cow dung manure or vermicompost.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Apply mustard cake tea, rose food, or balanced NPK 19-19-19 every 2 weeks during blooming season.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Winter and spring are peak blooming seasons in India. Prune in October to stimulate vigorous new flowering branches.
Pests & Pruning Care: Watch for aphids, thrips, and powdery mildew. Spray organic neem oil (5ml/L) or mild systemic fungicide.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
356,"Plant Name: Hibiscus
Botanical Name: Hibiscus rosa-sinensis
Local / Known Names: Mandara, Gurhal, China Rose, Shoe Flower
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Direct Sunlight (5-7 hours)
Watering Instructions: Regular daily watering in summer; reduce slightly in winter. Keep root ball moist but not waterlogged.
Soil Requirements: Rich, organic-rich fertile garden soil with sand and vermicompost for swift drainage.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Feed with potassium-rich organic fertilizer or banana peel fertilizer every 15 days for continuous large blooms.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Year-round blooming in tropical climates. Pinch branch tips regularly to encourage dense branching.
Pests & Pruning Care: Susceptible to mealybugs and whiteflies. Treat with soap-water wash followed by neem oil spray.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
357,"Plant Name: Jasmine Mogra
Botanical Name: Jasminum sambac
Local / Known Names: Arabian Jasmine, Gundu Malli, Motia, Mogra
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Sun to Bright Morning Sunlight
Watering Instructions: Water deeply 2-3 times a week; daily in peak summer heat. Allow surface soil to dry slightly.
Soil Requirements: Light sandy loam soil mixed with compost and leaf mould.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Feed with bone meal or decomposed organic manure monthly. Prune aggressively after main flowering cycle.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Blooms profusely from March to August with heavenly sweet fragrance.
Pests & Pruning Care: Generally pest hardy. Watch for leaf-eating caterpillars and spray neem solution.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
358,"Plant Name: Royal Jasmine
Botanical Name: Jasminum grandiflorum
Local / Known Names: Jaji, Chameli, Spanish Jasmine
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Sun (5+ hours)
Watering Instructions: Moderate regular watering. Avoid stagnant water around roots.
Soil Requirements: Well-aerated fertile loamy soil.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Apply balanced organic manure once a month during spring.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Vigorous blooming climber producing fragrant star-shaped white flowers.
Pests & Pruning Care: Occasional aphids; spray neem oil.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
359,"Plant Name: Night Blooming Jasmine
Botanical Name: Cestrum nocturnum
Local / Known Names: Raat Ki Rani, Night Queen
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Sunlight to Dappled Afternoon Shade
Watering Instructions: Keep evenly moist during summer flowering season.
Soil Requirements: Fertile garden loam with good organic matter.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Feed organic vermicompost every 4 weeks in growing season.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Produces clusters of small greenish-white flowers that release intense fragrance after sunset.
Pests & Pruning Care: Pinch tips for bushy shape.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
360,"Plant Name: Parijat
Botanical Name: Nyctanthes arbor-tristis
Local / Known Names: Night-Flowering Jasmine, Harsingar, Coral Jasmine
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Direct Sun
Watering Instructions: Moderate watering; drought tolerant once established.
Soil Requirements: Tolerates diverse soils from sandy to alluvial delta loam.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Feed twice a year with vermicompost.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Sacred night-blooming tree; blooms drop at dawn creating a carpet of orange-stemmed white flowers.
Pests & Pruning Care: Very low maintenance.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
361,"Plant Name: Bougainvillea
Botanical Name: Bougainvillea spectabilis
Local / Known Names: Paper Flower, Kagitham Puvvu
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Intense Full Sunlight (6-8 hours required)
Watering Instructions: Low to moderate water. Withhold water slightly to trigger massive flowering flushes.
Soil Requirements: Well-draining sandy loam or rocky garden soil. Intolerant of soggy soil.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Feed with low-nitrogen, high-phosphorus/potassium fertilizer.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Continuous vibrant paper-like bracts across purple, red, orange, white, and yellow colors.
Pests & Pruning Care: Extremely pest resistant.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
362,"Plant Name: Marigold
Botanical Name: Tagetes erecta / Tagetes patula
Local / Known Names: Banti, Genda, African Marigold, French Marigold
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Direct Sunlight
Watering Instructions: Water when topsoil feels dry. Water at the base, not on petals.
Soil Requirements: Porous, well-draining garden soil.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Apply liquid seaweed or mustard cake fertilizer every 10 days.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Essential festive flowering plant with bright yellow, orange, and bronze blooms.
Pests & Pruning Care: Natural pest repellent; protects nearby garden crops.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
363,"Plant Name: Chrysanthemum
Botanical Name: Chrysanthemum morifolium
Local / Known Names: Chamanti, Guldaudi, Mums
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Bright Sunlight (Morning sun ideal)
Watering Instructions: Keep soil consistently moist but never soggy.
Soil Requirements: Rich organic compost mixed with garden soil and cocopeat.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: High-potash fertilizer every 10 days leading to winter flowering.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Spectacular winter blooms in hundreds of vibrant colors and flower forms.
Pests & Pruning Care: Watch for aphids; treat with mild neem spray.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
364,"Plant Name: Crossandra
Botanical Name: Crossandra infundibuliformis
Local / Known Names: Kanakambaram, Firecracker Flower
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Bright Indirect Light to Mild Morning Sun
Watering Instructions: Water when surface dries. Appreciates humid conditions.
Soil Requirements: Rich, well-draining humus-rich delta soil.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Apply organic compost or sea kelp fertilizer monthly.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Traditional South Indian orange/salmon bloom used for garlands and hair ornaments.
Pests & Pruning Care: Keep away from harsh midday scorching sun.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
365,"Plant Name: Nerium Oleander
Botanical Name: Nerium oleander
Local / Known Names: Ganneru, Kaner, Oleander
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Sun (Intense heat tolerant)
Watering Instructions: Low water requirement. Drought hardy evergreen shrub.
Soil Requirements: Adaptable to virtually any soil from coastal to clay.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Requires minimal fertilizer; compost in spring suffices.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Profuse clusters of pink, red, white, or yellow flowers year-round.
Pests & Pruning Care: Toxic if ingested; naturally deer and pest resistant.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
366,"Plant Name: Plumeria
Botanical Name: Plumeria rubra / Plumeria alba
Local / Known Names: Champa, Frangipani, Temple Tree
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Full Direct Sunlight (6+ hours)
Watering Instructions: Low to moderate water. Succulent stems store moisture; do not overwater.
Soil Requirements: Sandy, gritty, well-draining soil mix.
Fertilizer & Nutrition: Phosphorus-rich fertilizer in spring and summer to induce heavy blooms.
Botanical Features & Seasonal Care: Exquisite, intensely fragrant flowers with velvety petals in white-yellow, pink, and deep crimson.
Pests & Pruning Care: Deciduous in cool winters.
Green Shade Nursery Availability: Available in various sizes at Green Shade Nursery, Kadiyapu Savaram."
367,"Plant Name: Gardenia
Botanical Name: Gardenia jasminoides
Local / Known Names: Gandharaj, Cape Jasmine
Category: Flower
Sunlight & Light: Bright Morning Sun with Dappled Afternoon Shade
Watering Instructions: Keep soil evenly moist. High humidity lover.
